by name set characters.\n\nFooterColumn: padding 0, VERTICAL, itemSpacing 14; title text 16 SemiBold ink; then 4 texts 15 Regular #54545E named Link1..4.\n\nSizes: footer width fixed 1440 with inner width 1312. Use auto-layout with paddingLeft/Right 64, width fixed 1440: set primaryAxisSizingMode FIXED? For VERTICAL layout: width fixed via resize(1440, h) then counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'. children rows: layoutAlign STRETCH.\n\nLet me write:\n\nFooter comp:\n```\nf.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; f.itemSpacing=56; f.paddingTop=72; f.paddingBottom=56; f.paddingLeft=64; f.paddingRight=64;\nf.resize(1440, 500); f.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; f.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\nf.fills=[solid(WHITE)]; top border: strokes? only bottom border needed: use strokes on frame → all sides. Instead divider rects inside.\n```\nTop divider: thin rect above content? Add rect 1px at top: child stretched width fill: layoutAlign='STRETCH', height 1, fill border. Put as first child to separate from CTA band. And divider between row1 and row2.\n\nRow heights: row1 ~56; row2: columns ~ (4*20+3*14+ title 20+14) ≈ 150; left col: logo 36 + gap + social 24 ≈ 80.\n\nTotal: 72+56+56+1+56+150+56 ≈ 447. primaryAxisSizingMode AUTO handles.\n\nNav items in header: instance navNo 4x, override text: inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT').characters='Sell' — but navNo comp has one text child; override fine.\n\nHeader height 88: resize(1440,88) counterAxis FIXED; primaryAxis SPACE_BETWEEN with children: logo, navRow, button.\n\nAlso header bottom border: strokes [border] strokeWeight 1, strokeBottomWeight? Individual stroke weights: node.strokeBottomWeight available on frames. Set strokeTopWeight=0 etc. Frames support individual strokeWeights (strokeTopWeight, etc.). I'll set strokes + individual weights.\n\nAlso position: header at x, y=3200 area. Components zone y2900 row; place header/footer below at y=3100.\n\nAlso create \"Page Label\"? no.\n\nWrite Call 3.","signature":"dc8118047644412fab399093"}],"id":"09e952