hite 92%, width 560), button. Position: x=56, y = 600 - 56 - contentHeight. Compute after creation: content.height → y=600-56-content.height.\n\nButton instance: btnDefault (7:2) — 'See all listings'.\n\nSection title sizes: agency h3 28; but let me use 32 for agency headings for better hierarchy. Type scale: h2 40 (section headings like \"Find your next place to live\"), agency h3 32/40 Bold.\n\nCopy: exact strings:\n- Hero copy: \"Hand-picked homes, honest advice and a team that knows every street in the neighbourhoods we serve.\"\n- Good hands copy: \"Our agents have helped more than 2,000 families buy, sell and rent. We listen first, explain every step and stay with you until the keys are in your hand.\"\n- Local experts copy: \"We live where we work. From school catchments to the quietest blocks, we can tell you what the listing photos don't.\"\n\nNote apostrophe: \"don't\" — in brief it's \"don’t\". Use curly apostrophes: \"don’t\", \"You’re in good hands\". I'll use \\u2019.\n\nPhoto instance resize: Photo_Agents_Meeting comp is 330x220; instance resize(600,420) — image fill FILL scales.\n\nWrite Call 5 now. Also name frame exactly '01_Home'.","signature":"36fc0ab2fbed49f7a919615a"}],"id":"ee2df974-3a08-4656-ae7e-d6a640ffe458","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78243550-d1f1-4909-8c2b-393b72e47362","uuid":"67853c66-9dcb-4c87-95bb-5d3693c38f28","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:52:05.402Z","thinking_duration_ms":26299}
