{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/rQsVjyS3FLCJmO37vlAUQN/ (fileKey rQsVjyS3FLCJmO37vlAUQN). Requirements:\n   - Confirm via whoami that the assigned account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (DONE — confirmed, user_id 1692091428764723877)\n   - Read 00 · Start Here for the task brief; 01 · Foundations for visual rules; reuse 02 · Components; use 04 · Media assets\n   - Deliver the complete design inside 03 · Workspace (page 5:2); preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes\n   - Build exactly 2 frames named \"01_Home\" and \"02_Property\" (1440 wide, light mode), wire them as a clickable prototype\n   - Build all other states/components (header, footer, business components) as reusable components\n   - Copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" verbatim; brand color #FFAC12 and DM Sans are fixed; everything else (neutrals, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation, grid) is designer's choice, applied consistently\n   - Required states: hover, focused field, selected thumbnail, current testimonial, open filter\n   - Prototype links: 01_Home \"See all listings\" + each listing card → 02_Property; 02_Property header Logo → 01_Home; similar listing cards → 02_Property\n   - Use get_screenshot to verify; fix visible problems; finish all screens/states/flows before final answer\n   - Process rule: every assistant message with a tool call must start with \"Reasoning summary:\" and final response must have \"Reasoning summary:\" line then \"Final answer:\" — finish with file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work, remaining limitations\n   - No shell access in this environment: use get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true for inline images\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code runs in sandbox; `figma` global; max 50000 chars/call)\n   - CRITICAL BEHAVIOR: if a use_figma call throws, the ENTIRE call's changes are rolled back (verified twice by listing page children)\n   - Recurring bug pattern: the `text()` helper is async; forgetting `await` before appendChild → \"in appendChild: The node with id 'undefined' does not exist\"\n   - `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` required to switch pages (gotcha: setting figma.currentPage unsupported)\n   - Fonts must be loaded before text ops: `figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans',style:s})` for Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold (available styles confirmed via listAvailableFontsAsync)\n   - `figma.combineAsVariants([nodes], page)` for component sets with names like 'State=Default'\n   - Instance overrides: `inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT').characters=...`; nested photo swap via `nestedInstance.swapComponent(comp)` (planned); icon recolor via findAll VECTOR strokes/fills\n   - Auto-layout: layoutMode, primaryAxisSizingMode/counterAxisSizingMode ('AUTO'/'FIXED'), layoutAlign='STRETCH', primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN'/'CENTER'\n   - Prototype reactions planned: `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'INSTANT'}}}]` — not yet tested\n   - Individual stroke weights on frames (strokeTopWeight/strokeBottomWeight) for one-sided borders\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file rQsVjyS3FLCJmO37vlAUQN pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 5:2 (03 · Workspace — delivery target)\n   - Reference component specs read: Button 1:22 = 180x56, fill #FFAC12, radius 4, text DM Sans Bold 16 black, auto-layout H; Text Field 1:25 = 400x74 V auto-layout, Label DM Sans Bold 14 black, Input frame 400x48 white fill stroke #E4E4E4 (0.894) radius 4, Placeholder DM Sans Regular 16 #8C8C8C\n   - Cloned asset components in workspace (page 5:2), with IDs:\n     - Button 7:2, TextField 7:4, Logo_Mark 7:8 (11x33 amber vector), Icon_Area 7:10, Icon_Arrow_Right 7:13 (24x12 stroke icon), Icon_Bath 7:15, Icon_Bed 7:19 (14x11), Icon_Calendar 7:22, Icon_Check 7:25 (16x16 dark circle + white check), Icon_Chevron_Down 7:28 (12x8), Icon_Chevron_Left 7:30 (24x24), Icon_Chevron_Right 7:32, Icon_Floors 7:34, Icon_Garage 7:37, Logo_Facebook 7:42, Logo_Instagram 7:44, Avatar_Client 7:48, Avatar_Kayley_Hall 7:49, Logo_Twitter 7:50, Photo_Agents_Meeting 7:52, Photo_Hero_House 7:53, Photo_Listing_1 7:54, Photo_Listing_2 7:55, Photo_Listing_3 7:56, Photo_Listing_4 7:57, Photo_Listing_5 7:58, Photo_Modern_House_1 7:59, Photo_Modern_House_3 7:60, Photo_Modern_House_4 7:61, Photo_Modern_House_5 7:62, Photo_Modern_House_6 7:63, Photo_Modern_House_7 7:64, Photo_Modern_House_Main 7:65, Photo_Listing_6 7:66, Photo_Modern_House_2 7:67\n     - Assets positioned in rows at y=0 and y=360 across x 0..2900\n   - Created components (all on page 5:2):\n     - Button set 8:7: State=Default (7:2, radius 6, padding L/R 28 T/B 17.5, hidden arrow child 'Icon_Arrow_Right' ink-colored) + State=Hover (8:4, fill #E99906). To override button label: `inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT').characters='...'`; show arrow: `inst.findOne(n=>n.name==='Icon_Arrow_Right').visible=true`\n     - Text Field set 8:16: State=Default,Type=Field (7:4), State=Focused,Type=Field (8:8, brand stroke 2px), State=Default,Type=Textarea (8:12, Input 400x120, placeholder 'Hello, I am interested in…'). Label child named 'Label', input 'Input', placeholder text 'Placeholder'\n     - Logo 8:17: Logo_Mark instance 12x36 + 'NORTHGATE' DM Sans Bold 24, letterSpacing 8%, ink\n     - Nav Item set 8:25: Current=No (8:21, text 'Buy' DM Sans Medium 16 ink) / Current=Yes (8:23, brand color)\n     - Icon Button 8:26: 48x48 circle, white fill, border stroke, child 'Icon_Chevron' (chevron left) at x=12,y=12\n     - Text Link 8:29: 'Learn more' SemiBold 16 brand + brand arrow (H auto-layout, gap 10)\n     - Header 9:5: 1440x88, white, bottom border #E7E7EB, padding 64, SPACE_BETWEEN: Logo instance / Nav row (4 NavItem instances Buy/Sell/Rent/About) / Button 'Work with us'\n     - Footer Column 9:22: Title text ('Title') + Link 1..4 texts\n     - Footer 9:28: 1440 wide, V auto-layout padding 64/64/72, dividers, Row Top ('Make your dreams a reality' 40 Bold + Button 'Work with us'), Row Bottom: Brand col (Logo + social instances Facebook/Twitter/Instagram) + 3 Footer Column instances (Company: About us/Our agents/Careers/Contact; Services: Buy a home/Sell a home/Rent a home/Property management; Resources: Market reports/Buyer guide/Seller guide/FAQ)\n     - Listing Card 12:39: 416 wide V auto-layout, radius 12, border, photo instance 'Photo' (Photo_Listing_1, 416x236 STRETCH), Body (padding 22/18/20): 'Name' text ('Malto House' 20 SemiBold), Meta row with 3 groups (icon instance 'Icon' + texts 'Bed'='4 bd', 'Bath'='2 ba', 'Area'='1,650 sq ft' 14 Regular INK2)\n     - Filter Field set 12:79: State=Default (12:60: 'Label' 13 SemiBold MUTED='Location', 'Value Row' SPACE_BETWEEN with 'Value' text 16 Medium='New York, NY' + 'Chevron' instance, 280x62) / State=Open (adds 'Menu' with Options 'Any price','$300k – $500k','$500k +', shadow). Width 280, use layoutGrow=1 in bar\n     - Stat Tile 12:80: 'Icon Box' 44x44 radius 10 WARM with 'Icon' (Bed default), 'Number' 22 Bold ('4'), 'Label' 14 INK2 ('Bedrooms')\n     - Feature Item 12:88: 'Icon_Check' instance + 'Label' 15 Regular ('Air conditioning')\n     - Testimonial Client set 12:103: Current=No (12:93) / Current=Yes (12:98): Avatar 56x56 r28, 'Name' 16 ('Leo Madrigal'), 'Role' 14 ('Client'; current=brand SemiBold)\n     - Gallery Thumb set 12:108: State=Default (12:104, 176x120 r10, border, 'Photo' child MH1) / State=Selected (brand 2px stroke)\n   - Shared code pattern per call:\n```js\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nawait Promise.all(['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold'].map(s=>figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans',style:s})));\nconst get = id => figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\nconst solid = c => ({type:'SOLID',color:c});\nconst BRAND={r:1,g:0.6745,b:0.0706}, BRAND_H={r:0.9137,g:0.6,b:0.0235}, INK={r:0.102,g:0.102,b:0.122}, INK2={r:0.329,g:0.329,b:0.369}, MUTED={r:0.545,g:0.545,b:0.580}, BORDER={r:0.906,g:0.906,b:0.922}, WARM={r:0.980,g:0.969,b:0.949}, WHITE={r:1,g:1,b:1};\nasync function text(chars,size,style,color,name){ const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style:style}; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size; t.fills=[solid(color)]; if(name)t.name=name; return t; }\n```\n   - Positions: core sets at y=2900 (Button x0, Text Field x230, Logo x750, Nav Item x1057, Icon Button x1210, Text Link x1378); Header (0,3150), Footer Column (1560,3150), Footer (0,3350); Listing Card (0,3800), Filter Field (480,3800), Stat Tile (840,3800), Testimonial Client (840,3960), Feature Item (1020,3960), Gallery Thumb (1020,4120). Planned: 01_Home at (0,4600), 02_Property at (1600,4600)\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - Error 1 (Step 4 first attempt): `filterField()` appended un-awaited `text()` promise → \"in appendChild: The node with id 'undefined' does not exist\" at filterField. Fix: made filterField async and awaited all text calls. Discovered the failed call fully rolled back (page children listing showed no partial nodes)\n   - Error 2 (Step 4 second attempt): `tclient()` had `const nm=text(...)` / `const ro=text(...)` without await → same appendChild error, full rollback. Fix: made tclient async, awaited both text calls → Step 4 succeeded (third attempt)\n   - Error 3 (Step 5, CURRENT): 01_Home build failed in `agencySection()` — `const tt=text(title,32,'Bold',INK,'Title');` and `const cp=text(copyStr,18,'Regular',