{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Listings section added. Now Step 7: Testimonial section (WARM bg), CTA band (BRAND bg), Footer instance.\n\nTestimonial section:\n- WARM bg, padding 64, 96 top/bottom\n- Quote text ~32 Medium: \"Kayley and the team found us a home we love in under a month. They knew every street, never pushed us, and we always felt in good hands.\" lineHeight ~44, width ~900\n- 3 Testimonial Client instances: Leo Madrigal = Current=Yes variant (12:98), Owen Brooks + Mia Chen = Current=No (12:93) with name/role overrides\n- The testimonial set is 12:103 with Current=No (12:93) and Current=Yes (12:98)\n\nLayout: V auto-layout gap 48, quote then row of 3 clients (H auto-layout gap 48? or 64). Maybe with a left brand quote mark? Keep simple: heading maybe none. Add quote directly.\n\nCTA band: BRAND bg full-bleed (1440 wide), padding 64, H SPACE_BETWEEN center: left col ('Ready to sell your home?' 40 Bold ink; copy 18 INK2-ish... on amber background, ink text). Copy: 'Get a free valuation and a clear plan to sell at the right price, on your timeline.' Right: Button 'Work with us' or Text Link. I'll use Button 'Get started' — hmm, brief copy. Use Button 'Work with us'? The CTA — maybe Text Link 'Get a free valuation'. I'll put a Button 'Get a free valuation'. Ink text on brand amber is fine (Button text is black/ink already).\n\nFooter: instance of 9:28.\n\nStructure append order: Testimonial, CTA, Footer.\n\nOverrides on testimonial client instances: Name and Role texts. Current=Yes variant for Leo Madrigal (role 'Client'). Owen Brooks 'Client', Mia Chen 'Client'? Maybe roles differ: 'Client', 'Seller', 'Buyer'. I'll use Client/Seller/Buyer.\n\nCode:\n\n```js\nconst tset=await get('12:103'); \nconst variants = tset.children; find Current=Yes by name\n```\nVariant nodes named 'Current=Yes' and 'Current=No'. Use tset.findOne(n=>n.name==='Current=Yes').\n\nThen create instances from those variant components directly (12:98 / 12:93 known, but safer to findOne).\n\nQuote text: 32 Medium, lineHeight 44, color INK, width 880, autoResize HEIGHT.\n\nClients row: H gap 48.\n\nCTA band: frame 'CTA' fill BRAND, padding L/R 64, T/B 88, H layout SPACE_BETWEEN, counterAxis CENTER. Left col V gap 16 width 720: title 40 Bold ink lineHeight 48; copy 18 Regular ink (maybe INK with 0.8 opacity? Keep INK2? On amber, dark ink reads well). Copy: 'Get a free valuation and a clear plan to sell at the right price, on your timeline.' width 640.\nRight: Button instance 'Get a free valuation' — button component 7:2 (State=Default). Show arrow? Button has hidden arrow child 'Icon_Arrow_Right'; brief CTA — I'll show arrow for flair: findOne(n=>n.name==='Icon_Arrow_Right').visible=true. Hmm wait, the Button component 7:2 — its arrow child colored ink. Fine, visible=true.\n\nActually careful: Button comp 7:2 is the raw component (also variant inside set 8:7). createInstance works on COMPONENT 7:2. Fine — same as before with hero button.\n\nFooter: (await get('9:28')).createInstance().\n\nLet me write it.","signature":"d740b53193194328a5d4f58a"}],"id":"23462013-f35d-47bd-a8bc-395d5408a2f3","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78243550-d1f1-4909-8c2b-393b72e47362","uuid":"abc75b0f-3b92-441e-9cf0-e95ddce385e6","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:56:43.211Z","thinking_duration_ms":16588}
