dth or by section name 'Similar'). Use ancestor: find sec 'Similar' via prop.findOne(n=>n.name==='Similar'), then findAll cards.\n4. Header logo in property: prop.findOne(n=>n.name==='Header').findOne(n=>n.name==='Logo').\n\nReaction assignment:\nnode.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'CLICK'},action:{type:'NODE',destinationId:'16:271',navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'INSTANT'}}}]\n\nHmm — for action NODE: properties are destinationId, navigation, transition. Also may need `overlay` fields absent. I think this shape is right. If assignment throws, rollback — so do the whole prototype step in ONE call but carefully. If it errors, everything in that call rolls back (no harm, just retry).\n\nAlso should set frames' prototype starting point? Not required. Also add reactions: hero button + 6 cards home → 16:271. Logo + 4 similar cards → 13:83? No: similar cards go to 02_Property (self, for prototype browsing) — per summary: \"similar listing cards → 02_Property\". Yes.\n\nAdditionally maybe set overflow scrolling — not required.\n\nLet me write the prototype call.","signature":"89d2b5248f0e4f328c76bdc1"}],"id":"095580e5-2371-446e-9b82-f66590df1fb0","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78243550-d1f1-4909-8c2b-393b72e47362","uuid":"efdbfd02-c1f1-4714-af41-47d78c6d0d88","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:00:07.818Z","thinking_duration_ms":17178}
